class.description:
Accept the same providers in the same order on every peer with [method NetwAdmissionConfig.accept]. The joining peer runs [method _prove] for each one, then the server runs [method _verify] for each one, before the admission handler sees the [NetwJoinRequest].
[codeblock]
class_name PasscodeAccount
extends NetwAccountProvider

func _prove(challenge: String, _session: NetwSession) -> Variant:
    return (PASSCODE + challenge).sha256_text()

func _verify(request: NetwJoinRequest, proof: Variant) -> Variant:
    if proof is String and proof == (PASSCODE + request.challenge).sha256_text():
        request.add_account("club:" + request.username, request.username)
    return OK
[/codeblock]
Proving and verifying count against [member NetwMultiplayer.auth_timeout]. [NetwIdToken] is a ready provider for signed tokens.
